# Python

- Python 3.12, `from __future__ import annotations`, full type hints; dataclasses / NamedTuples for data.
- ruff, line length 120. Run format before finishing.
- Dependencies only via `uv add` / `uv add --dev`; never pip.
- The engine stays pure (no I/O, no asyncio, no randomness outside `Game.rng` / `Bot.rng`).
- Seeded randomness everywhere so games and bugs are reproducible.
- Tests are plain pytest functions; prefer building real games over mocks. Keep the suite fast (< 10 s).
